Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:51:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Tonal: sign-in form for the pairing page

Tonal's Auth0 only accepts its own app's redirect, so the authorization
URL is our own form. It signs in with the password or email-code grant,
parks the tokens in Redis under a one-time code and redirects to the
normal OAuth callback, whose code exchange redeems it. Each user can now
connect their own Tonal from /users/<id>/pair. A 400-day backfill is
queued five minutes after connecting, after the callback's 90-day one.

